rem Hexadecimal Numbers
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=162
rem Count the hexadecimal numbers of up
rem to Digits digits, without a leading
rem zero, that hold 0, 1 and A, and
rem print the count in hexadecimal

use numbers
use sequences
use text
use io
use cli

option Digits integer = 16

rem Inclusion and exclusion over the
rem digits left out. The first digit
rem is never zero.
N = 1 to Digits array
All' = 15 * 16 ** (N - 1)
No0' = 15 ** N
No1' = 14 * 15 ** (N - 1)
No01' = 14 ** N
No1A' = 13 * 14 ** (N - 1)
No01A' = 13 ** N
Count' = All - No0 - 2 * No1 + 2 * No01 + No1A - No01A
Answer = Count sum
Bases = array shape Digits fill 16
Ds = Answer Bases digits
Code' = Ds + (Ds greater 9 choose 55 48)
Chars' = Code character rank 0
Text = Chars "" join
Text print
